window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A family contract. A dark bargain. No escape.</b></p> <p>Eleven years ago, I met him. A year later, I was betrothed to him. Now he’s come to claim me, slaughtering anyone standing in his way.</p> <p>My husband-to-be is a monster from a family as ruthless and powerful as mine, a man who deals in violence and destruction...a man terrifyingly like my father. For more than a decade, he’s stalked me, shadowing my life.</p> <p>I fear him. I hate him. Worst of all, I want him.</p> <p>My name is Alina Molotova, and Alexei Leonov is a fate I can’t escape.</p>"; 
